{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The small office is a blend of cozy and gaudy. Rude British accents like a bust of Queen Victoria make the room almost feel like a real embassy’s office, but the neon glow of the Union Jack and the rich bar rack tell you it's still a nightclub.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][A citrus perfume wafts in the air. The smell is awfully familiar, but its owner is nowhere to be seen.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: Where did she go? #line:015caec 
